Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers the CaseTrail source code and documentation in this
repository only. It does NOT cover:

- The IL-TUR dataset (Joshi et al., 2024), which is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and
  gated on Hugging Face. It is not included in this repository; it is downloaded
  by scripts/download_data.py after accepting its conditions. Results derived
  from it (results/) are reported for non-commercial research and teaching use.
- Pretrained models (sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2: Apache-2.0;
  intfloat/e5-small-v2: MIT; BAAI/bge-reranker-base: MIT), which keep their own
  licences. Models fine-tuned from them are not included in this repository.
- Third-party libraries, which keep their own licences (see requirements.txt and
  frontend/package.json).

CaseTrail is a research and teaching aid. It does not give legal advice.
